# Searches (ripgrep, and the AI tools built on it) skip history: the current truth lives in each
# game's AGENTS.md, design/ and DECISIONS.md. Read a file under archive/ directly when a question is
# about the past.
games/*/archive/
# The demo's template: the game you work on is the installed copy in games/yak-trail/. Search the
# template only by naming it (templates/demo/), when changing what new users get.
templates/demo/
